---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact — Yousif Husni" description="Get in touch with Yousif Husni about software opportunities, projects, and collaborations.">
<section class="container contact-page"><div class="contact-title"><p class="eyebrow">GOOD THINGS START WITH A CONVERSATION</p><h1>Say hello<span>.</span></h1><p>Have an interesting problem?<br/>Let's figure out what we can build.</p></div><div class="contact-grid"><a class="email-card" href="mailto:yousifmoyaser@gmail.com"><div class="card-top"><span class="eyebrow">01 / THE BEST WAY TO REACH ME</span><span>↗</span></div><h2>You've got an idea.<br/>I've got an inbox.</h2><span class="email-address">yousifmoyaser@gmail.com</span><span class="email-cta">Write me an email →</span></a><div class="contact-side"><a class="connect-card" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yousif-husni" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="eyebrow">02 / PROFESSIONAL</span><h2>Let's connect <span>↗</span></h2><p>Find me on LinkedIn for opportunities and collaborations.</p></a><a class="connect-card" href="https://github.com/yousifH-02" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="eyebrow">03 / BEHIND THE BUILDS</span><h2>Follow the code <span>↗</span></h2><p>Projects, experiments, and what I'm working on next.</p></a></div></div><div class="contact-detail"><div><p class="eyebrow">BASED IN</p><p>Houston, Texas <span class="muted">/ Central Time</span></p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">ELSEWHERE</p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/YXSF.H/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a></div><div><p class="eyebrow">TIME-SENSITIVE BUSINESS</p><a href="tel:8322177825">832-217-7825 ↗</a><p class="muted note">Email is preferred.</p></div></div><div class="contact-bottom"><p class="muted">Looking for the short version of my experience?</p><a class="button" href="/resume/">Grab my resume ↗</a></div></section>
</Layout>
<style>
.contact-page{padding:70px 0}.contact-title h1{font-size:clamp(76px,11vw,148px);margin-top:35px}.contact-title>p:last-child{font-size:25px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--muted);margin:30px 0 45px}.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:24px}.email-card{background:#ff6268;color:#230d11;border-radius:12px;padding:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:background .2s}.email-card:hover{background:#ff7a80}.card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}.email-card .eyebrow{color:#461520;font-size:10px}.card-top>span:last-child{font-size:32px}.email-card h2{font-size:43px;margin:48px 0 30px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.email-address{font-size:clamp(15px,1.7vw,22px);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.email-cta{margin-top:45px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #a33547;font-size:13px}.contact-side{display:grid;gap:24px}.connect-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:30px;background:#1b161a;transition:border-color .2s}.connect-card:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}.connect-card h2{font-size:28px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-top:18px}.connect-card h2 span{color:var(--accent)}.connect-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:18px 0 0}.contact-detail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:38px 0;font-size:14px}.note{font-size:12px}.contact-bottom>p{font-size:14px}@media(max-width:760px){.contact-page{padding-top:45px}.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.email-card{padding:26px}.email-card h2{font-size:37px}.contact-detail{grid-template-columns:1fr}.contact-title>p:last-child{font-size:22px}}
</style>
